ifierRequest":"449bac51-5d8d-42e8-8ca7-d0e34c5f2458","apiBlockIndex":0,"requestId":"req_011Cfe42ajujDjC6ga59FzTE","attributionSkill":"closeout","type":"assistant","uuid":"b4f83423-f7d8-42d1-9a8b-d3b9a5c170fd","timestamp":"2026-10-02T20:37:08.893Z","advisorModel":"claude-fable-5-1","effort":"medium","perTurnEffort":"medium","session_id":"11427f4a-8383-4d35-918e-9715ee26f83a","sessionKind":"bg","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/Users/kristinarash/DEV","sessionId":"11427f4a-8383-4d35-918e-9715ee26f83a","version":"2.1.288","gitBranch":"main"}
{"parentUuid":"b4f83423-f7d8-42d1-9a8b-d3b9a5c170fd","isSidechain":false,"promptId":"92a94e88-8c2e-4cd7-b98f-30ddbd977735","type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01Pesd85aL7sLvrhmuQU25xL","type":"tool_result","content":" M projects/-Users-kristinarash-DEV/3cbd7684-d6cc-4898-a8eb-e75e8dbed3d3.jsonl\n M projects/-Users-kristinarash-DEV/6dce9bea-22de-4294-be8b-ed7247624d42.jsonl\n M projects/-Users-kristinarash-DEV/dd4081c0-a71e-46f2-860a-e83f59d2bc85.jsonl\n?? projects/-Users-kristinarash--claude-claude-memory-compiler/d7def491-615d-4b71-aefb-c3fa23c68e8e.jsonl\n?? projects/-Users-kristinarash-DEV/11427f4a-8383-4d35-918e-9715ee26f83a.jsonl\n?? projects/-Users-kristinarash-DEV/a70d9b79-37ba-4d8e-9368-7c84968dd82a.jsonl\n M transcripts/2026-10-02.md\n M data/weekly_forecast_log.csv\nhandoffs\nSTATUS.md\n# STATUS\n\nRead this first. Update it before ending every session.\n\n## Current state\n- 2026-09-23: Captured all 16 Big 12 teams (12 games each). In Week 3 the model picked the right winner in 12 of 14 unique games. The misses were Colorado vs Northwestern (model had Colorado by 1; Colorado lost 7-41) and West Virginia over Virginia 38-27 (31% forecast). Baylor is at 6.36 expected wins (raw 6-6), up from 5.27. The model re-rated Oklahoma State up and Colorado down.\n- `scripts/weekly_run.sh` now skips the comparison when the capture fails (3619c54). Before, a failed capture printed last week's comparison as if it were new.\n- Playwright auto-updated and now needs browser build `chromium-1243`. It is installed on the Mac. See `docs/handoffs/2026-09-23-week3-capture.md`.\n- Snapshots are in `data/weekly_snapshots/`, and copies plus comparison reports are in `../CFB_Forecast_Archive/2026/`.\n\n## Next\n1. Run the next Big 12 capture on Wednesday 2026-09-30: `scripts/weekly_run.sh`. Run it headed, from the main checkout, on the Mac.\n\n## Open questions\n- ~~`worktree-eval-all-games`: merge or delete?~~ Deleted 2026-09-23. All five of its files were already on `main`, byte-identical. Tip was b863846.\n- ~~What made Windows capture Baylor at 07:37 on 9/23?~~ Answered 2026-09-23: no capture task exists on Windows. The daily `CFB-ForecastCaptureReminder` popup (07:25) prompted a manual run. That task is now disabled on Windows.\n\n## Gotchas\n- `uv run --with playwright` pulls the newest playwright. When it updates, the capture dies with `Executable doesn't exist at .../chromium-<N>`. Fix: `uv run --with playwright python -m playwright install chromium`, then re-run.\n- **The Mac owns the weekly capture (decided 2026-09-23).** Never run it on Windows. Two machines writing the same day's snapshot and `data/weekly_forecast_log.csv` conflict at the next sync.\n- Run the capture from the main checkout, not a worktree. `ARCHIVE = ROOT.parent / \"CFB_Forecast_Archive\"` resolves to the wrong folder inside `.claude/worktrees/`, so use `--no-archive` there and copy by hand.\n- A capture must run headed. A dropdown's search box renders about 1s after the click, and the script waits for it. If it fails with `search box never appeared`, the report UI changed.\n- One failed attempt per team is normal; the retry recovers it.\n\n## History\n- 2026-09-23: Week 3 capture; wrapper skips compare on failure (3619c54); Mac/Windows merge conflict resolved in 5bebba8.\n- 2026-09-16: Search-box fix (b15b875) and Big 12 capture (90c90cd).\n- 2026-09-10: Captured and froze Baylor's forecast (4.49 expected wins). Auburn graded as a correct side with a 3-point margin miss.\n- 2026-09-09: Repo brought under git and pushed to erash11.","is_error":false}]},"uuid":"3e9601a5-f82a-4abf-a0d0-a3a7f1788afd","timestamp":"2026-10-02T20:37:09.551Z","toolUseResult":{"stdout":" M projects/-Users-kristinarash-DEV/3cbd7684-d6cc-4898-a8eb-e75e8dbed3d3.jsonl\n M projects/-Users-kristinarash-DEV/6dce9bea-22de-4294-be8b-ed7247624d42.jsonl\n M projects/-Users-kristinarash-DEV/dd4081c0-a71e-46f2-860a-e83f59d2bc85.jsonl\n?? projects/-Users-kristinarash