hen re-run.\n- **The Mac owns the weekly capture (decided 2026-09-23).** Never run it on Windows. Two machines writing the same day's snapshot and `data/weekly_forecast_log.csv` conflict at the next sync.\n- Run the capture from the main checkout, not a worktree. `ARCHIVE = ROOT.parent / \"CFB_Forecast_Archive\"` resolves to the wrong folder inside `.claude/worktrees/`, so use `--no-archive` there and copy by hand.\n- A capture must run headed. A dropdown's search box renders about 1s after the click, and the script waits for it. If it fails with `search box never appeared`, the report UI changed.\n- One failed attempt per team is normal; the retry recovers it.\n\n## History\n- 2026-09-23: Week 3 capture; wrapper skips compare on failure (3619c54); Mac/Windows merge conflict resolved in 5bebba8.\n- 2026-09-16: Search-box fix (b15b875) and Big 12 capture (90c90cd).\n- 2026-09-10: Captured and froze Baylor's forecast (4.49 expected wins). Auburn graded as a correct side with a 3-point margin miss.\n- 2026-09-09: Repo brought under git and pushed to erash11.","stderr":"","interrupted":false,"isImage":false,"noOutputExpected":false},"serverClassifierContext":{"request":"449bac51-5d8d-42e8-8ca7-d0e34c5f2458","context":{"git_state":{"cwd":"/Users/kristinarash/DEV","root":"/Users/kristinarash/DEV","branch":"main","default_branch":"main","status":{"clean":true,"counts":{"staged":0,"modified":0,"untracked":null,"untracked_normal":0},"porcelain":null,"truncated":false},"visibility":{"origin":{"host":"github.com","remote":"erash11/DEV","visibility":"private"},"push_remote":"origin","remotes":[{"name":"origin","host":"github.com","remote":"erash11/DEV","visibility":"private"}],"visibility_cache":[{"host":"github.com","remote":"erash11/DEV","visibility":"private"},{"host":"github.com","remote":"erash11/CFB_Victory_Model","visibility":"private"}]}},"live_cwd":"/Users/kristinarash/DEV","platform":"macos"}},"sourceToolAssistantUUID":"b4f83423-f7d8-42d1-9a8b-d3b9a5c170fd","session_i