{"parentUuid":"940de010-ce70-4b79-937f-a0b9bec03916","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011Cfe42qGH5aY3EXUK3rzw2","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_01S1pFPUsdd1SmZHd5T5vSPs","name":"Bash","input":{"command":"cd /Users/kristinarash/DEV/CFB_Victory_Model && python3 - <<'EOF'\np='docs/STATUS.md'; s=open(p).read()\nold_cs=s[s.index('## Current state\\n')+len('## Current state\\n'):s.index('- `scripts/weekly_run.sh` now skips')]\nnew_cs=\"\"\"- 2026-10-02 (Fri): Captured all 16 Big 12 teams. Week 4 graded: the model picked 6 of 8 unique games right. Misses: Kansas State over Cincinnati (43% Cincinnati; Cincinnati won 31-26) and West Virginia over Oklahoma State (33% Oklahoma State; Oklahoma State won 41-24, 27-pt margin miss). Baylor beat Colorado 23-13 (forecast 30-20, margin miss 0). Baylor is at 6.73 expected wins (raw 6-6), up 0.37. Model re-rated Oklahoma State and UCF up, Kansas State and West Virginia down.\n- The 9/30 Wednesday capture was skipped. No forecast was lost: no games were played between 9/26 and 10/2 (no Week 5 game shows as played).\n\"\"\"\ns=s.replace(old_cs,new_cs,1)\ns=s.replace(\"1. Run the next Big 12 capture on Wednesday 2026-09-30: `scripts/weekly_run.sh`. Run it headed, from the main checkout, on the Mac.\",\"1. Run the next Big 12 capture on Wednesday 2026-10-07: `scripts/weekly_run.sh`. Run it headed, from the main checkout, on the Mac.\")\ns=s.replace(\"## History\\n\",\"## History\\n- 2026-10-02: Week 4 capture (Friday; 9/30 skipped, nothing lost). 6/8 sides correct.\\n\",1)\nopen(p,'w').write(s)\nEOF\ncat > docs/handoffs/2026-10-02-week4-capture.md <<'EOF'\n# 2026-10-02 — Week 4 Big 12 capture\n\n## What\nRan `scripts/weekly_run.sh` on the Mac (headed). All 16 teams captured, 12 games each. Two first-attempt retries, no final failures. Compare + archive ran.\n\n## Timing\nThe Wednesday 9/30 run was missed; this ran Friday 10/2. No forecast was lost: the newest played games are Week 4 (9/26), and no Week 5 game shows as played.\n\n## Week 4 grading (8 unique games, 6 sides correct)\n| Game | Forecast | Actual | Side | Margin miss |\n|---|---|---|---|---|\n| Arizona vs Washington State | 25-20 (0.62) | 34-24 | correct | 5 |\n| Baylor vs Colorado | 30-20 (0.69) | 23-13 | correct | 0 |\n| Kansas State vs Cincinnati | 33-31 (0.57 KSU) | 26-31 | WRONG | 7 |\n| Houston vs Georgia Southern | 34-19 (0.79) | 42-28 | correct | 1 |\n| Utah vs Iowa State | 29-23 (0.63) | 31-17 | correct | 8 |\n| West Virginia vs Oklahoma State | 35-25 (0.67 WVU) | 24-41 | WRONG | 27 |\n| UCF vs TCU | 29-24 (0.58) | 21-13 | correct | 3 |\n| Texas Tech vs Sam Houston State | 38-13 (0.89) | 49-14 | correct | 10 |\n\nByes: BYU, Kansas, Arizona State.\n\n## Expected wins (change since 9/23)\nOklahoma State 7.58 (+1.86), UCF 8.56 (+1.57), Cincinnati 8.44 (+1.20), Utah 10.03 (+1.00), Houston 7.23 (+0.54), Arizona 6.11 (+0.45), Texas Tech 9.40 (+0.40), Baylor 6.73 (+0.37), BYU 8.51 (-0.31), Kansas 3.43 (-0.34), Arizona State 6.40 (-0.51), TCU 5.39 (-0.73), Iowa State 5.11 (-1.03), Colorado 3.69 (-1.06), Kansas State 7.74 (-1.32), West Virginia 6.69 (-1.33).\n\n## Biggest swings\nOklahoma State vs Kansas State (wk10) +33 pts to 58%; Houston vs Kansas State (wk6) +25 to 58%; Utah vs BYU (wk10) +25 to 63%; UCF vs Arizona State (wk11) +24 to 74%. Driven by the Oklahoma State, UCF and Utah up-ratings.\n\n## Files\n- `data/weekly_snapshots/2026-10-02_*.csv` (16)\n- `data/weekly_forecast_log.csv` (now 1128 rows)\n- `../CFB_Forecast_Archive/2026/` (snapshots + compare text)\n- `docs/STATUS.md`, this handoff\n\n## Next\n1. Capture Wednesday 2026-10-07 on the Mac.\nEOF\ngit add -A && git commit -qm \"Week 4 Big 12 capture 2026-10-02; STATUS + handoff\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_018E6335wJJwETtSRKGLK117\" && git pull -q --no-rebase && git push -q 2>&1 | tail -2; git log --oneline -1\ncd ../CFB_Forecast_Archive && git add -A && git commit -qm \"Archive 2026-10-02 Big 12 capture\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_018E6335wJJwETtSRKGLK117\" && git pull -q --no-rebase && git push -q 2>&1 | tail -2; git log --oneline -1","description":"Update STATUS, write handoff, commit and push both CFB repos"},"caller":{"type":"direct"}}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":1805,"cache_read_input_tokens":86916,"output_tokens":2399,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":172},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":1805,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"not_available","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":2399,"cache_read_input_tokens":86916,"cache_creation_input_tokens":1805,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":1805},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard","fallback_credit":null},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"wireToolInputs":{"toolu_01S1pFPUsdd1SmZHd5T5vSPs":{"command":"cd /Users/kristinarash/DEV/CFB_Victory_Model && python3 - <<'EOF'\np='docs/STATUS.md'; s=open(p).read()\nold_cs=s[s.index('## Current state\\n')+len('## Current state\\n'):s.index('- `scripts/weekly_run.sh` now skips')]\nnew_cs=\"\"\"- 2026-10-02 (Fri): Captured all 16 Big 12 teams. Week 4 graded: the model picked 6 of 8 unique games right. Misses: Kansas State over Cincinnati (43% Cincinnati; Cincinnati won 31-26) and West Virginia over Oklahoma State (33% Oklahoma State; Oklahoma State won 41-24, 27-pt margin miss). Baylor beat Colorado 23-13 (forecast 30-20, margin miss 0). Baylor is at 6.73 expected wins (raw 6-6), up 0.37. Model re-rated Oklahoma State and UCF up, Kansas State and West Virginia down.\n- The 9/30 Wednesday capture was skipped. No forecast was lost: no games were played between 9/26 and 10/2 (no Week 5 game shows as played).\n\"\"\"\ns=s.replace(old_cs,new_cs,1)\ns=s.replace(\"1. Run the next Big 12 capture on Wednesday 2026-09-30: `scripts/weekly_run.sh`. Run it headed, from the main checkout, on the Mac.\",\"1. Run the next Big 12 capture on Wednesday 2026-10-07: `scripts/weekly_run.sh`. Run it headed, from the main checkout, on the Mac.\")\ns=s.replace(\"## History\\n\",\"## History\\n- 2026-10-02: Week 4 capture (Friday; 9/30 skipped, nothing lost). 6/8 sides correct.\\n\",1)\nopen(p,'w').write(s)\nEOF\ncat > docs/handoffs/2026-10-02-week4-capture.md <<'EOF'\n# 2026-10-02 — Week 4 Big 12 capture\n\n## What\nRan `scripts/weekly_run.sh` on the Mac (headed). All 16 teams captured, 12 games each. Two first-attempt retries, no final failures. Compare + archive ran.\n\n## Timing\nThe Wednesday 9/30 run was missed; this ran Friday 10/2. No forecast was lost: the newest played games are Week 4 (9/26), and no Week 5 game shows as played.\n\n## Week 4 grading (8 unique games, 6 sides correct)\n| Game | Forecast | Actual | Side | Margin miss |\n|---|---|---|---|---|\n| Arizona vs Washington State | 25-20 (0.62) | 34-24 | correct | 5 |\n| Baylor vs Colorado | 30-20 (0.69) | 23-13 | correct | 0 |\n| Kansas State vs Cincinnati | 33-31 (0.57 KSU) | 26-31 | WRONG | 7 |\n| Houston vs Georgia Southern | 34-19 (0.79) | 42-28 | correct | 1 |\n| Utah vs Iowa State | 29-23 (0.63) | 31-17 | correct | 8 |\n| West Virginia vs Oklahoma State | 35-25 (0.67 WVU) | 24-41 | WRONG | 27 |\n| UCF vs TCU | 29-24 (0.58) | 21-13 | correct | 3 |\n| Texas Tech vs Sam Houston State | 38-13 (0.89) | 49-14 | correct | 10 |\n\nByes: BYU, Kansas, Arizona State.\n\n## Expected wins (change since 9/23)\nOklahoma State 7.58 (+1.86), UCF 8.56 (+1.57), Cincinnati 8.44 (+1.20), Utah 10.03 (+1.00), Houston 7.23 (+0.54), Arizona 6.11 (+0.45), Texas Tech 9.40 (+0.40), Baylor 6.73 (+0.37), BYU 8.51 (-0.31), Kansas 3.43 (-0.34), Arizona State 6.40 (-0.51), TCU 5.39 (-0.73), Iowa State 5.11 (-1.03), Colorado 3.69 (-1.06), Kansas State 7.74 (-1.32), West Virginia 6.69 (-1.33).\n\n## Biggest swings\nOklahoma State vs Kansas State (wk10) +33 pts to 58%; Houston vs Kansas State (wk6) +25 to 58%; Utah vs BYU (wk10) +25 to 63%; UCF vs Arizona State (wk11) +24 to 74%. Driven by the Oklahoma State, UCF and Utah up-ratings.\n\n## Files\n- `data/weekly_snapshots/2026-10-02_*.csv` (16)\n- `data/weekly_forecast_log.csv` (now 1128 rows)\n- `../CFB_Forecast_Archive/2026/` (snapshots + compare text)\n- `docs/STATUS.md`, this handoff\n\n## Next\n1. Capture Wednesday 2026-10-07 on the Mac.\nEOF\ngit add -A && git commit -qm \"Week 4 Big 12 capture 2026-10-02; STATUS + handoff\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_018E6335wJJwETtSRKGLK117\" && git pull -q --no-rebase && git push -q 2>&1 | tail -2; git log --oneline -1\ncd ../CFB_Forecast_Archive && git add -A && git commit -qm \"Archive 2026-10-02 Big 12 capture\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_018E6335wJJwETtSRKGLK117\" && git pull -q --no-rebase && git push -q 2>&1 | tail -2; git log --oneline -1","description":"Update STATUS, write handoff, commit and push both CFB repos"}},"serverClassifierRequest":"c9f0a752-d5d7-4099-8eac-4e0aac5150bc","apiBlockIndex":2,"requestId":"req_011Cfe42pzfJs2dGAncTJayT","attributionSkill":"closeout","type":"assistant","uuid":"16f231ec-7f31-4247-a5a0-8e3f25798604","timestamp":"2026-10-02T20:37:28.780Z","advisorModel":"claude-fable-5-1","effort":"medium","perTurnEffort":"medium","session_id":"11427f4a-8383-4d35-918e-9715ee26f83a","sessionKind":"bg","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/Users/kristinarash/DEV","sessionId":"11427f4a-8383-4d35-918e-9715ee26f83a","version":"2.1.288","gitBranch":"main"}
