{"parentUuid":"437ea7ea-8967-4016-9ad5-41e418ee5543","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011Cfe46f7CYbSfyhXNAKKKn","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"The capture worked: all 16 Big 12 teams were saved. Closeout is done too, and every repo is pushed.\n\n**No forecast was lost.** Today is Friday, and the Wednesday 9/30 run was missed. But no games were played between 9/26 and today. No Week 5 game shows as played yet.\n\n**Week 4 grading.** The model picked the right winner in 6 of 8 games.\n- Baylor beat Colorado 23-13. The model said 30-20, so it got the 10-point margin exactly.\n- Miss: the model favored Kansas State over Cincinnati. Cincinnati won 31-26.\n- Big miss: the model gave West Virginia 67% against Oklahoma State. Oklahoma State won 41-24. That is a 27-point miss.\n\n**Expected wins now vs 9/23:**\n\n| Team | Exp wins | Change |\n|---|---|---|\n| Utah | 10.03 | +1.00 |\n| Texas Tech | 9.40 | +0.40 |\n| UCF | 8.56 | +1.57 |\n| BYU | 8.51 | -0.31 |\n| Cincinnati | 8.44 | +1.20 |\n| Kansas State | 7.74 | -1.32 |\n| Oklahoma State | 7.58 | +1.86 |\n| Houston | 7.23 | +0.54 |\n| Baylor | 6.73 | +0.37 |\n| West Virginia | 6.69 | -1.33 |\n| Arizona State | 6.40 | -0.51 |\n| Arizona | 6.11 | +0.45 |\n| TCU | 5.39 | -0.73 |\n| Iowa State | 5.11 | -1.03 |\n| Colorado | 3.69 | -1.06 |\n| Kansas | 3.43 | -0.34 |\n\n**Big swings.** The model now rates Oklahoma State, UCF and Utah higher.\n- Oklahoma State vs Kansas State (week 10) moved +33 points, to 58%.\n- Houston vs Kansas State (week 6) moved +25 points, to 58%.\n- Utah vs BYU (week 10) moved +25 points, to 63%.\n\nNothing looked wrong. Every team has 12 games. No game appeared or vanished.\n\n## Closeout — 2026-10-02\n\n**Committed & pushed:**\n- `CFB_Victory_Model`: 16 snapshots, the log, STATUS and a handoff.\n- `CFB_Forecast_Archive`: copies of the snapshots and the comparison text.\n- `~/.claude/global-memory`\n- `~/.claude`\n\n**STATUS.md:** updated in `/Users/kristinarash/DEV/CFB_Victory_Model/docs/STATUS.md`. The next capture is set for Wednesday 10/7.\n\n**Memory:** today's transcript is saved, and the docs harvest ran. Windows also wrote to today's transcript log, which caused a merge conflict. I kept both sides.\n\n**Handoff:** `/Users/kristinarash/DEV/CFB_Victory_Model/docs/handoffs/2026-10-02-week4-capture.md`\n\n**Still open:**\n1. The error log `~/.claude/global-memory/transcripts/.errors.log` still has 3 old entries. I did not fix them:\n   - `perch-pull` failed on 10/1.\n   - The KeystoneOS AI OS audit is due.\n   - `daily-backup` reported `manifest-unmanaged:42Analytics`.\n2. `~/.claude` shows 1 changed file. That is this session's own log, which keeps growing while the session runs. It is safe to leave.\n\nClear to sign off.\n\nresult: Week 4 Big 12 forecasts captured for all 16 teams (6 of 8 winners right, no forecast lost); all repos pushed; next capture Wednesday 10/7."}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":298,"cache_read_input_tokens":94422,"output_tokens":1328,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":35},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":298,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"not_available","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":1328,"cache_read_input_tokens":94422,"cache_creation_input_tokens":298,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":298},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard","fallback_credit":null},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"serverClassifierRequest":"9ff0c561-79ed-4f90-9d4a-31dcb777ba45","apiBlockIndex":1,"requestId":"req_011Cfe46er5kW22tzXaS5jNn","attributionSkill":"closeout","type":"assistant","uuid":"f87a76c9-c0f4-4e76-8c4e-939d74eeb234","timestamp":"2026-10-02T20:38: